WEBVTT

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:27.920
It seems our final showdown with the Precure is at hand.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.870
Yes.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.100
Not having last-minute doubts, I trust?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:38.510
The Precure and I... we shall fight until one side can fight no longer.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.180
This is the moment I have been waiting for.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:48.080
Even at this climactic moment, still all you care about is doing battle?

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:58.040
Well, I can't say I have much admiration for your blunt-headed nature.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:01.380
But I do find great beauty in watching you fight.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:04.120
Where's this coming from? You're creeping me out.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.290
I'm merely speaking my mind. Don't read anything into it.

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:12.670
You're so haughty it infuriates me.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.960
But I respect your strength!

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.350
Your validation means nothing to me, you realize?

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:24.270
Neither does yours.

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:33.150
You shall go no further, Precure!

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.200
HeartCatch

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.660
Precure!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.200
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.200
Now, all together

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:47.720
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.720
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:58.300
Within each of our chests,

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.970
they begin to sprout

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.640
The seeds of the heart

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:03.890
are growing

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.510
bit by bit

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:07.180
Red,

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:07.800
white

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:09.100
and yellow

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.860
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.320
all varied colors

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:14.790
that they

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.940
shine so brightly!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:22.280
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.780
with such care

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.500
will never wither

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.080
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.960
Now, all together

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.420
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:39.090
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.970
They're always right by our sides

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.800
So together

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:48.690
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.650
bloom even more!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.150
HeartCatch

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.650
Precure!

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.100
I'm afraid this...

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.830
is where you die!

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:16.090
You always have to spoil the moment.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:20.680
Leave them to me.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:24.320
You can't handle both of them alone.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.140
Allow me to help as well.

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.030
I'll stay here and help Sunshine.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:34.860
Blossom, Moonlight, you two go rescue your grandma.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.940
Don't worry. We'll catch up.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:43.660
Or do you think we can't handle it?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.210
Of course not!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:00.630
I don't think so!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:19.270
Kumojacky<i>!</i> Kobraja<i>!</i>

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:19.270
Kumojacky<i>!</i> Kobraja<i>!</i>

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.470
That was quite the move.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:32.250
That's not even gonna slow them down!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:44.800
Split up like this, you're no match for us.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.670
Cure Sunshine.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.680
You are worthy of being my opponent.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:56.140
Come, let us do battle on a more fitting stage for the occasion.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.610
Bring it on!

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.200
What's so funny?

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:16.670
Is turning the world into a desert really that amusing to you?!

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:21.590
I don't care about your planet.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.960
Reaching the zenith of my strength, and doing battle with the strong...

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.600
That is all I desire!

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:37.130
Your beauty and mine, pitted against each other in a graceful battle!

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:40.610
Truly, a performance befitting the end of the world.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:45.490
There's no beauty to be found in 
making the world suffer like this!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:50.140
Alas, I have no empathy for that which has no beauty.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:54.160
Especially your pathetic human hearts.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.920
You stupid...

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:01.880
I hope you put up a good fight, Cure Marine!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:12.000
Do you realize how many Flowers you've stolen from people's Hearts for your stupid "desire"?!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.750
I'll never accept your twisted thinking!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:33.980
Marine and Sunshine are risking
 their lives to allow us to proceed.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:35.980
We mustn't let that be in vain.{this is literally "You should consider what that means/implies." but like it's obvious what she means the vague bullshit that sounds dumb in English can eat a dick imo}

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:51.260
Just try to stop me, Precure.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.260
Futile!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.950
Your attacks are futile!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:47.860
You cannot even compare to the strength I desire!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.740
Marine!

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.130
Without an opponent like you...

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:22.550
I would not be able to stage a battle of such utmost beauty.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:41.230
Do try to live up to my expectations, Cure Sunshine!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.290
Now, let us make this battle even more beautiful.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.750
Yes... let us create a work of unparalleled art!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.640
Sunshine!

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:09.990
What is this?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.900
Look!

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:22.270
Dark... Precure!

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.270
Blossom, go on ahead.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:45.950
Moonlight?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.200
<i>I have to bring this to an end.</i>

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:57.150
<i>I have to defeat Dark Precure, and the person I once was.</i>

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.680
<i>The person you were?</i>

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:02.520
<i>The one who rejected friendship and allowed her fairy to die.</i>

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:04.790
<i>The one who lost to Dark Precure.</i>

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:10.510
<i>If I can defeat Dark Precure, that will 
prove I'm not that foolish child anymore.</i>

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.510
<i>Moonlight...</i>

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:20.890
Sabark.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.880
If it wasn't for you and Dark Precure...

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:37.950
Dark Precure... She told us she was an artificial Precure.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:41.500
It was you that created her, wasn't it?

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:57.480
Why did you make Dark Precure in Moonlight's image?

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.510
In her image?

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:04.180
Yes. Don't tell me you hadn't noticed?

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.640
If Moonlight represents the light,

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:09.140
then Dark Precure is its shadow.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.350
They're two sides of the same coin.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.510
This is the end.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.550
I won't let you!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.120
Coffret!

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:30.660
What are you doing?!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.080
Are you trying to get hurt?!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:36.100
I don't mind what happens to me if I can save you!

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:43.800
A powerless little fairy dares to strike the mighty Kumojacky?!

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.960
So, you still have some power left.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.980
Now this is getting interesting!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.070
Cure Marine, fight me with everything you've got!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.230
Let's go, Coffret!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.620
Right!

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.480
What is this power?

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.590
Cure Marine!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.720
What's made you this strong?!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:34.080
You keep going on about strength, but you don't have the first clue what it means!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.060
What?!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:40.420
You called Coffret a powerless little fairy.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:44.260
But he still tried to fight you!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.320
He risked his life to try to save me!

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:52.970
He might not be able to fight like we can, but he's billions of times stronger than you'll ever be!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:53.960
Yeah!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:59.950
The desire to protect others—true strength is that strength of heart!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:18.060
How pathetic, Cure Sunshine.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.800
I just can't bear to see you 
rendered so unseemly like this.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:25.500
I shall give you the beautiful end you 
deserve with my own beautiful hands.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:28.720
You're sho not beautiful, Kobraja!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:29.530
What?

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:31.490
Potpourri!

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:35.990
As if a fairy would even be capable of appreciating my beauty!

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:37.170
You're heartless!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.330
What?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:42.880
No matter what happens, Sunshine has 
the shtrength of heart to protect people.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:46.470
That'sh more beautiful than you'll ever be!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.340
Potpourri...

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.530
Thank you!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.350
I told you before!

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:54.930
The heart is useless!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.430
I don't care how pathetic or unseemly you think I am.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:15.040
I want to protect the world... and its smiles, radiant as the Sun itself!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.040
It's always bothered me.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:30.370
If you'd ordered Dark Precure to finish her then and there,

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.680
you could have defeated Moonlight for good.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.230
But you didn't.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.270
No, you couldn't.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.880
Something deep inside you couldn't allow it.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.040
What are you rambling about?

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:49.590
You saved Moonlight... You saved Yuri.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.690
Snackies! Guard the prisoner!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.350
Sabark, why?

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:16.430
Kumojacky, you are really strong.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.510
But what do you want to do with that strength?

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:22.840
What do I want to do?

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:24.720
Yeah.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:30.520
I want to be a Precure and protect the world!

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:34.620
I want to live with Blossom and my friends, and for us to be happy together!

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:38.250
And I'll become as strong as it takes to do that!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:40.330
I'll never give in!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:51.290
But all you care about is <i>being</i> strong.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:56.140
That's just so sad.

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:59.660
You may very well be right.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.010
But even so...

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:05.030
I can't allow myself to be swayed!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:12.300
You've toyed with so many hearts just because you want to be stronger.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.230
You've made our world a desert!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:20.160
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.430
Gather, Floral Power!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:41.700
Marine Tact!

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:52.490
Making new friends, and growing closer together

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:52.860
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:58.450
I've changed enough to face whatever the future brings

00:16:56.170 --> 00:17:00.580
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:04.400
I want us to protect this whole wide world

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:10.750
There's nothing to fear when we stand hand in hand

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:16.750
Rather than shining on those who are already loved

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.830
I want my gentle light

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:25.100
To shine on those who've never known love

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:31.230
I'll keep looking forward, running toward the sunlight

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.510
Such beauty.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:32.590
You act without hesitation to leap to the aid of total strangers,

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:34.770
I want to realize this dream not for myself

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:35.260
yet still fight to the last to protect your world.

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:38.760
But for everyone around me

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:39.400
Is this the beauty you find in the heart?!

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:44.750
Once the world makes it through the winter

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.750
Oh, had I only learned of this sooner.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.300
And our future starts to bloom again

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:54.460
I'll bring it light with my sunshine!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:53.880
But it's far too late now! {sounding a little Walz Gill here Kobraja}

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.440
Sunflower Aegis!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.310
Sunshine Impact!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.480
There's still time, Kobraja!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:12.690
The darkness in your heart shall be illuminated by my light!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:16.270
Like the Sun in the sky, I want to shine on everyone

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:23.940
And bring a smile to the faces of people trapped by fear

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:25.450
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:29.820
The energy of the Sun exists for everyone

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:29.390
Shiny Tambourine!

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:33.560
And the joy of protecting the people I love

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:39.230
Will become the power of sunshine!

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:45.640
Flowers, dance for me!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:51.860
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:16.420
You've bested me, Cure Marine.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:24.320
It seems your world had a lot left to teach me about what strength is.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.440
So beautiful.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.670
A fitting end for me, don't you think?

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:47.730
I'm glad it could be at your hands, Cure Sunshine.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.410
Adieu!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:58.300
In the language of flowers, a rugosa rose represents "beauty in sadness."

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:01.800
Beauty in sadness...

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:07.440
All because he was too busy looking for outer beauty.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:09.430
It's sho sad.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:15.620
In the language of flowers, an 
Achillea alpina represents "battle."{"nokogirisou" literally translates to "saw-grass", but it's a completely different flower from the western sawgrass, just in case anyone flags it up and goes "isn't this just sawgrass????"}

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.460
He really did love to fight, didn't he?

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.680
Grandma!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.630
Tsubomi?!

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:02.600
Lord Coupe!

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:09.950
Thank you, Tsubomi.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.960
Cure Flower! How can we repair the Great Heart Tree?!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:16.930
With the Heart Pot.

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:20.520
By using the Heart Seeds, with all the feelings they represent,

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:23.110
we can bring back the Great Heart Tree.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:28.880
But first, we need to defeat Dune and put a stop to his tremendous power.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.640
Moonlight!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.850
I've got to help her!

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:40.150
Lord Coupe, look after Grandma!

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:41.350
Tsubomi!

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:43.990
Please.

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:47.620
Don't let Moonlight fight Sabark.

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:04.460
Now, the light shall be enveloped by shadow!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.980
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:08.990
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.240
Lose yourself in the melody!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.910
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:21.130
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:27.260
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.640
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:46.400
<i>In the midsts of the battle with Dark Precure,</i>

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.940
<i>Professor Sabark's tragic identity is revealed...</i>

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:50.360
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:51.200
<i>This can't be happening!</i>

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:54.660
<i>I can't take this in...</i>

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:56.410
<i>Moonlight, you mustn't give in!</i>

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:59.240
<i>You can't let this sadness continue!</i>

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:02.830
<i>HeartCatch Precure:</i>

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:06.420
Please, Say It's Not True<i>!</i>

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:06.420
Please, Say It's Not True<i>!</i>

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:09.110
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
